      "content": "<p>The number of incorrect statements from the following is ___________.</p>\n<p>A. The electrical work that a reaction can perform at constant pressure and temperature is equal to the reaction Gibbs energy.</p>\n<p>B. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.626ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.039ex\" height=\"2.164ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -680 1785.1 956.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"45\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-45\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(714,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(714,-268.8) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"63\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-63\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1166,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> cell is dependent on the pressure.</p>\n<p>C. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17.033ex\" height=\"3.266ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1090.6 7528.7 1443.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,481.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(848.3,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(1752.9,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> cell </text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1660.7,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"3985.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4502.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(5558.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(866,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1193.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(589,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(557.6,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1730.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>D. A cell is operating reversibly if the cell potential is exactly balanced by an opposing source of potential difference.</p>",
